{"seq":1,"slug":"s4-structured-ssm","title":"S4 结构化状态空间","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/state-space-models-mamba/architectures/s4-structured-ssm","wordCount":1574,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"s4-结构化状态空间\">S4 结构化状态空间</h1><p>基础章留下了一个看似已经成立、实则跑不动的系统。卷积核 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>K</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>C</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>B</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>C</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>A</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>B</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>C</mi><msup><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>A</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>B</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{K}=(C\\bar{B}, C\\bar{A}\\bar{B}, \\dots, C\\bar{A}^{L-1}\\bar{B})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0913em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1111em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1111em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 理论上能并行训练，但朴素地算它要把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>A</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{A}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1111em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 一路自乘 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 次，序列长上万时既慢又会数值爆炸或下溢。HiPPO 给出的那个稠密 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 矩阵更让事情雪上加霜——稠密矩阵幂运算是灾难。S4（Structured State Space Sequence model，Gu 等人 2022）的全部贡献，就是给 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 套上一个「结构化」的紧身衣，让卷积核能被又快又稳地算出来。它是第一个真正在长程基准上打败 Transformer 的 SSM，也是后续一切的起点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-朴素-ssm-卡在哪\">核心概念：朴素 SSM 卡在哪</h2><p>把困难拆开看，朴素长卷积核计算栽在三处。</p>\n<p>第一是<strong>算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>A</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{A}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1111em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的高次幂</strong>。卷积核第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 项是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><msup><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>A</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msup><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>B</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C\\bar{A}^i\\bar{B}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1111em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8247em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，要遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i=0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>。对稠密 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N\\times N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 矩阵反复自乘，单是这一步就是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N^2 L)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的运算量。</p>\n<p>第二是<strong>数值稳定性</strong>。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>A</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{A}=\\exp(\\Delta A)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1111em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">exp</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的特征值若略大于 1，高次幂指数级放大；略小于 1，则指数级衰减到下溢。长序列上误差累积得无法控制。</p>\n<p>第三是<strong>离散化本身的开销</strong>。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>A</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{A}=\\exp(\\Delta A)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1111em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">exp</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 涉及矩阵指数，对稠密矩阵是昂贵操作，而训练中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 都在更新，每步都要重算。</p>\n<p>S4 的解法是统一的：限制 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 的结构，让上面三件事都能落到「只需操作对角元素」的廉价路径上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"对角加低秩-dplr-结构\">对角加低秩：DPLR 结构</h2><p>HiPPO 矩阵虽稠密，却有个幸运的性质——它能被分解成<strong>对角加低秩</strong>（Diagonal Plus Low-Rank，DPLR）形式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Λ</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>P</mi><msup><mi>P</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">∗</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A = \\Lambda - P P^{*}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Λ</span></span></span></span></span> 是对角矩阵，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 是一个窄的低秩因子（秩为 1 或很小）。对角部分的矩阵幂只是对每个对角元素各自取幂，廉价至极；低秩修正项则可以用一套基于柯西核（Cauchy kernel）的特殊算法绕过显式矩阵幂来计算。S4 把卷积核的计算转化为求一个生成函数在单位根上的取值，再用柯西核乘法快速求出，整体把复杂度从朴素的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N^2L)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 降到接近 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N+L)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>这套 DPLR 机制的数学相当精巧，但工程要点只有一句：<strong>把记忆能力（来自 HiPPO 的结构）和计算可行性（来自对角主导的结构）统一在同一个参数化里</strong>。S4 证明了 HiPPO 矩阵恰好落在这个可计算的结构类里，不是巧合，而是 HiPPO 理论的内在性质。</p>\n<h2 id=\"s4d-干脆只用对角\">S4D：干脆只用对角</h2><p>DPLR 虽快，实现仍然繁琐——柯西核那套代码不好写也不好维护。后续工作发现一个意外简单的事实：把低秩项直接扔掉，只保留对角部分 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A=\\Lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Λ</span></span></span></span></span>，配合合适的初始化（如 HiPPO 对角近似 S4D-Lin、S4D-Inv），模型质量几乎不掉。这就是 <strong>S4D</strong>。纯对角 SSM 的卷积核计算退化成对每个对角元素算一个等比数列，简单到几行代码就能写完，且天然数值友好。</p>\n<p>与 S4D 同期的 <strong>DSS</strong>（Diagonal State Spaces）也独立得出了类似结论。下表对照这几个关键变体的取舍。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>变体</th>\n<th><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 的结构</th>\n<th>卷积核计算</th>\n<th>工程复杂度</th>\n<th>质量</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>朴素 SSM</td>\n<td>稠密</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N^2L)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 显式矩阵幂</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>不稳定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>S4（DPLR）</td>\n<td>对角 + 低秩</td>\n<td>柯西核，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≈</mo><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\approx O(N+L)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>高（柯西核难写）</td>\n<td>强</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>S4D</td>\n<td>纯对角</td>\n<td>对角等比数列</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>接近 S4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DSS</td>\n<td>纯对角（复数）</td>\n<td>对角 softmax 归一</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>接近 S4</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这条「从稠密到 DPLR 再到纯对角」的简化路线意义重大：它把后续 Mamba 的实现门槛大幅拉低。Mamba 直接采用对角 SSM 作为底座，正是站在 S4D 的肩膀上，详见 <a href=\"mamba-selective-ssm\">Mamba 选择性状态空间</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"初始化决定一切\">初始化决定一切</h2><p>结构化只解决了「算得快」，「学得好」还得靠初始化。S4 系列把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 的对角元素初始化为 HiPPO 矩阵的特征值（或其对角近似），这一步至关重要——前一篇 <a href=\"../foundations/ssm-fundamentals\">状态空间模型基础</a> 讲过，HiPPO 让状态成为历史的最优多项式投影，把这个性质带进初始化，模型一开始就具备长程记忆能力，训练只是微调。随机初始化的对角 SSM 在长程基准上会大幅落后，差距常常达到几十个百分点。这条经验后来也写进了训练实践，见 <a href=\"../practice/training-stability-tricks\">训练稳定性技巧</a>。</p>\n<p>下图把 S4 解决朴素 SSM 三大难题的逻辑串起来。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[朴素 SSM 卷积核难算] --&gt; B[难题1: A 的高次幂 O N²L]&#10;    A --&gt; C[难题2: 数值不稳定]&#10;    A --&gt; D[难题3: 矩阵指数离散化贵]&#10;    B --&gt; E[结构化 A 为对角加低秩 DPLR]&#10;    C --&gt; E&#10;    D --&gt; E&#10;    E --&gt; F[柯西核快速求卷积核]&#10;    F --&gt; G[S4D/DSS: 丢掉低秩只留对角]&#10;    G --&gt; H[HiPPO 初始化对角元素]&#10;    H --&gt; I[既快又稳又能记长程]\">graph TD\n    A[朴素 SSM 卷积核难算] --&gt; B[难题1: A 的高次幂 O N²L]\n    A --&gt; C[难题2: 数值不稳定]\n    A --&gt; D[难题3: 矩阵指数离散化贵]\n    B --&gt; E[结构化 A 为对角加低秩 DPLR]\n    C --&gt; E\n    D --&gt; E\n    E --&gt; F[柯西核快速求卷积核]\n    F --&gt; G[S4D/DSS: 丢掉低秩只留对角]\n    G --&gt; H[HiPPO 初始化对角元素]\n    H --&gt; I[既快又稳又能记长程]</pre><h2 id=\"s4-的历史地位与局限\">S4 的历史地位与局限</h2><p>S4 在长程竞技场基准（LRA，详见 <a href=\"../applications/long-sequence-modeling\">长序列建模</a>）上首次让一个非注意力架构全面超过 Transformer，尤其在长度上万的 Path-X 任务上，Transformer 直接失败而 S4 稳定求解。这是 SSM 复兴的引爆点。</p>\n<p>但 S4 有个和它的优点同源的局限：它是<strong>线性时不变</strong>系统，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>A</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>B</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{A},\\bar{B},C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0145em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1111em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 对每个输入位置都一样。这意味着模型无法根据内容决定「这个 token 重要，多记一会儿；那个是填充词，直接忽略」。它对所有输入一视同仁地卷积。在语言这种信息密度高度不均的模态上，这个缺陷很致命——而打破它，正是 Mamba 登场的理由。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>S4 解决的是朴素 SSM 卷积核「算得慢、数值不稳、离散化贵」三大工程难题。</li>\n<li>核心手段是把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 结构化为对角加低秩（DPLR），用柯西核把卷积核计算降到接近线性；S4D/DSS 进一步简化为纯对角，质量几乎不掉、实现极简。</li>\n<li>HiPPO 初始化是 S4 长程能力的关键，随机初始化会大幅落后。</li>\n<li>S4 是首个在 LRA 上全面超过 Transformer 的架构，但其线性时不变性使它无法做内容感知的选择，这一局限直接催生了 Mamba。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>打破时不变限制、引入选择性：<a href=\"mamba-selective-ssm\">Mamba 选择性状态空间</a>。</li>\n<li>S4 依赖的 HiPPO 与离散化基础：<a href=\"../foundations/ssm-fundamentals\">状态空间模型基础</a>、<a href=\"../foundations/discretization-recurrence\">离散化与递归形式</a>。</li>\n<li>S4 称霸的长程基准：<a href=\"../applications/long-sequence-modeling\">长序列建模</a>。</li>\n<li>对角化、特征值等数值背景与通用优化：<a href=\"../../deep-learning/training-at-scale/regularization-techniques\">深度学习 · 大规模训练</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"S4 结构化状态空间","id":"s4-结构化状态空间"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：朴素 SSM 卡在哪","id":"核心概念-朴素-ssm-卡在哪"},{"level":2,"text":"对角加低秩：DPLR 结构","id":"对角加低秩-dplr-结构"},{"level":2,"text":"S4D：干脆只用对角","id":"s4d-干脆只用对角"},{"level":2,"text":"初始化决定一切","id":"初始化决定一切"},{"level":2,"text":"S4 的历史地位与局限","id":"s4-的历史地位与局限"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"离散化与递归形式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/state-space-models-mamba/foundations/discretization-recurrence"},"next":{"title":"Mamba 选择性状态空间","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/state-space-models-mamba/architectures/mamba-selective-ssm"}}